or
.Li date .
Already a hypertable on that column: satisfied.
Refused when it is one on another column, when a unique index or primary key
leaves the time column out
.Pq Qq cannot create a unique index without the column \&"ts\&" (used in partitioning) ,
and when the table holds rows and
