.Sh CAVEATS
Policies are jobs, and a job edited by hand outside a specification is not
noticed, as pg_cron's are
.Pq Xr pg_laswell_pg_cron 7 .
Integer time columns are not supported by
.Cm timescaledb_create_hypertable .
